# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 10
A(('h1', S10))
A(('p', '**Purpose:** To follow the text itself and to mark what Jesus states and what He does not.'))
A(('p', '**Step 1. Read the story.** Read Matthew 22:1–14 slowly. Write each thing the king does: made a marriage, sent forth, was wroth, sent forth his armies, destroyed, burned, said, came in, saw, saith, said. Then write what those bidden do: would not come, made light of it, went their ways, took, entreated, slew.'))
A(('p', '**Step 2. Mark what Jesus identifies.** In the table below, write what Jesus says each item is. For each item, if the text gives no identification, write the sentence “Jesus does not identify it.”'))
